<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last month.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last month.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the month to August 1.</p>
<p>Top 10 largest gains in month</p>
<p>Rank Name			Price     pct change</p>
<p> 1  Macquarie Bank	    13.78	  21.95</p>
<p> 2  Oil Search		   4.16	  17.51</p>
<p> 3  Santos			 6.61	  16.37</p>
<p> 4  Fletcher-Energy div	4.64	  13.17</p>
<p> 5  Aust Foundation	    2.80	  12.00</p>
<p> 6  Howard Smith		 2.92	  11.45</p>
<p> 7  Great Central		2.78	  10.76</p>
<p> 8  Argo Inv		     3.45	  10.58</p>
<p> 9  Goodman Fielder	    2.10	  10.53</p>
<p>10  Rural Press		  4.50	   9.76</p>
<p>Top 10 largest falls in month</p>
<p>Rank Name			  Price     pct change</p>
<p> 1  Davids Ltd		   0.89	 -25.83</p>
<p> 2  Newcrest Mining	    2.72	 -24.23</p>
<p> 3  Sthn Pac Pete		3.51	 -17.22</p>
<p> 4  RGC			    4.16	 -13.33</p>
<p> 5  Goldfields		   1.74	 -12.12</p>
<p> 6  Lihir Gold		   1.98	 -11.21</p>
<p> 7  PMP Comms		    3.22	 -10.56</p>
<p> 8  Fletcher NZ Fst	  1.76	  -8.81</p>
<p> 9  WMC			    7.64	  -8.61</p>
<p>10  Broken Hill Pty	   18.01	  -7.74</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
